    "title": "Maroon Football Tickets On Sale - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Virginian Review Sports ,\n10 hours ago SALEM, Va. – Tickets for the 2026 Roanoke College football season opened July 1 and can be purchased now. The Maroons finished the 2025 season, its first season of varsity competition since 1942, 5-4 overall and 4-4 in conference play. Tickets will be sold for $10 individually or $40 for all five home games if purchased […]\nThe post Maroon Football Tickets On Sale appeared first on The Virginian Review .",
